    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northleoda">Norðleod.</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif he ænig land næbbe 7 þeah freoh sy, forgilde hine man mid LXX scill'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he has no land and nevertheless is free, one is to pay for him with 70 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gif he ænig land næbbe 7 þeh freoh sy, forgylde man hine mid LXX scll'.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if he does not have any land but is still free, then compensation for him shall be seventy shillings.</ab>
      </div>
